<urn:anqr:environment-realisation-model:1> <urn:usf:predicate:nonClaim> "Hosting and deployment targets are undetermined. Requirements in staging and the two production environments state what must hold once a target exists; none of them is claimed to be operational, and each records that its hosting is undecided." <urn:anqr:graph:environment-realisation> .
<urn:anqr:environment-realisation-model:1> <urn:usf:predicate:nonClaim> "Reusing the Foundation's environments is deliberate. localdev is development; ci, integrationtest and the two hermetic environments are test; staging and productionshaped are staging; productionlive is production." <urn:anqr:graph:environment-realisation> .
<urn:anqr:environment-realisation-model:1> <urn:usf:predicate:objective> "What ANQR must satisfy in each Foundation environment at each lifecycle stage, and how each requirement is decided. Development, test, staging and production are expressed through the eight environments the Foundation already declares rather than a parallel set." <urn:anqr:graph:environment-realisation> .
